    "detailed_description": "On a daring search and recover mission, fate catapults you through a mysterious wormhole, leaving you marooned in an uncharted sector of space. Prepare for the journey of a lifetime as you overcome the relentless pursuit of a rogue imperial legion, explore fantastical alien worlds, and put your resourcefulness to the test in search of a way back home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/32fdfd98f6dc51707e5c46c160fd4ddb.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Venture into the far reaches of the universe and discover lush forests teeming with alien life, mystical frozen mountains, and scorching crystalline lava fields. Each environment harbors unique creatures, resources, and hidden anomalies that push the boundaries of your imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/8cf71488f76807acf52164b05bb8a730.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/4e19209bc10402a5617481b2a494c9ad.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/4e19209bc10402a5617481b2a494c9ad.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/4e19209bc10402a5617481b2a494c9ad.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With deep character customization, forge a space explorer that suits your unique playstyle. As you progress, unlock powerful perks, enhance your attributes, and delve into groundbreaking research to access new technologies. Gain mastery over various disciplines to refine your skills and become an unstoppable force in the vast expanse of space.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/d06da520ab2faff46dd31731ae1b22b3.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/67652d70a2be2bc783e828d03fe6d73c.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/67652d70a2be2bc783e828d03fe6d73c.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/67652d70a2be2bc783e828d03fe6d73c.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Become a masterful engineer as you engage with intricate crafting systems. Scour the cosmos for an array of valuable resources, each holding a unique potential for enhancing your spaceship, weaponry, and equipment. Create remarkable items, discover innovative uses for crafting components, and improve resource refinement efficiency in a gratifying progression of skill and mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/a4929245db0a7806d2f9e428de731188.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover a world teeming with hidden treasures and powerful artifacts. Plunder and craft an extensive arsenal of unique weapons and equipment, each with distinct abilities, providing you with a strategic advantage in challenging battles against android armies and enigmatic creatures. With millions of items and hundreds of unique models, you can customize your appearance and gear to complete your ultimate build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/3172b0303b401014420ff2394aa8d44b.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare for an enthralling journey where you'll encounter puzzles to solve, treacherous cave systems to explore, and engaging conversations with your AI companion. Flee from hordes of relentless alien frogs, demolish structures with C4 explosives, wield your ship's mighty cannons, concoct mysterious potions, close interdimensional rifts, and intercept valuable supply drops. The realm of possibilities is vast, and the fate of the cosmos is in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/27b36fc481723926ba99ea874974a44e.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br>Far Horizon is a passion project brought to life by two brothers with a shared dream. We've poured our hearts and souls into every pixel and line of code, crafting an immersive experience that we hope you'll love as much as we do. Reach out to us on Discord with your opinions, ideas, and criticisms - <strong>we want to hear your feedback!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "On a daring search and recover mission, fate catapults you through a mysterious wormhole, leaving you marooned in an uncharted sector of space. Prepare for the journey of a lifetime as you overcome the relentless pursuit of a rogue imperial legion, explore fantastical alien worlds, and put your resourcefulness to the test in search of a way back home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/32fdfd98f6dc51707e5c46c160fd4ddb.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/fab15cf567b697fccadb4a8f3b1759ab.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Venture into the far reaches of the universe and discover lush forests teeming with alien life, mystical frozen mountains, and scorching crystalline lava fields. Each environment harbors unique creatures, resources, and hidden anomalies that push the boundaries of your imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/8cf71488f76807acf52164b05bb8a730.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/4e19209bc10402a5617481b2a494c9ad.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=26