lass=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/a4929245db0a7806d2f9e428de731188.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/7fb7001f6d9dcc25b23dc678e4fdfed8.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover a world teeming with hidden treasures and powerful artifacts. Plunder and craft an extensive arsenal of unique weapons and equipment, each with distinct abilities, providing you with a strategic advantage in challenging battles against android armies and enigmatic creatures. With millions of items and hundreds of unique models, you can customize your appearance and gear to complete your ultimate build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/3172b0303b401014420ff2394aa8d44b.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.poster.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.webm?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/10f0d31b63b249648f7a83f5c47bd6a4.mp4?t=1727097942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare for an enthralling journey where you'll encounter puzzles to solve, treacherous cave systems to explore, and engaging conversations with your AI companion. Flee from hordes of relentless alien frogs, demolish structures with C4 explosives, wield your ship's mighty cannons, concoct mysterious potions, close interdimensional rifts, and intercept valuable supply drops. The realm of possibilities is vast, and the fate of the cosmos is in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962680/extras/27b36fc481723926ba99ea874974a44e.avif?t=1727097942\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br>Far Horizon is a passion project brought to life by two brothers with a shared dream. We've poured our hearts and souls into every pixel and line of code, crafting an immersive experience that we hope you'll love as much as we do. Reach out to us on Discord with your opinions, ideas, and criticisms - <strong>we want to hear your feedback!</strong>",
